{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-legacy","title":"持久的遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-driven-innovation","title":"设计驱动的创新","url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/design-driven-innovation","wordCount":1686,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-jobs-mythology","title":"乔布斯神话","url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/the-jobs-mythology","wordCount":1835,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 持久的遗产\n\n乔布斯最持久的遗产，超越了任何具体产品，沉淀为理念与文化的层面。本章考察其中两项最深远的影响。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"设计驱动的创新\"——他如何确立并普及这一理念，让设计与体验成为创新的核心驱动力。第二篇文档讲述\"乔布斯神话\"，审视他身后形成的天才叙事，及其激励与误导并存的双刃效应。\n"}